repair-action-reuse-image = Reuse the existing image whose project and generation labels match.
repair-action-build-image = Build the image from the fixed snapshot.
repair-action-reuse-template = Reuse the existing template whose runtime id matches the verified image.
repair-action-load-template = Load the template from the verified archive.
repair-action-restore-workspace = Recreate the missing empty neutral workspace directory.
repair-action-create-sandbox = Create the sandbox.
repair-action-start-sandbox = Allow the first internal check to start the stopped sandbox.
repair-action-provision-interior = Connect to the unobserved sandbox interior and run every declared provisioning step: files, Git settings, credential helper, bare repository, and managed worktrees.
repair-action-place-declared-file = Place the declared file at { $destination }.
repair-action-configure-identity = Configure the git identity inside the sandbox.
repair-action-configure-credential-helper = Configure the credential helper inside the sandbox.
repair-action-create-bare-repository = Create the shared bare repository.
repair-action-create-worktree = Create the managed worktree at { $path }.
repair-action-clear-intent = Clear the intent only after read-only completion verification.
repair-done = { $project } was repaired; { $sandbox } is ready on generation { $generation }.
repair-no-change = { $project } needs no repair; { $sandbox } remains on generation { $generation }.

