status-item-remote-ssh = Remote SSH
legend-heading = Legend
legend-ready = available and matching the expected state
legend-missing = not present
legend-file-unchanged = the same content sbxm placed last, or without a record, the same as the host file
legend-file-updated = the host file changed after sbxm placed it; placing the declared files again puts it in place
legend-file-unplaced = sbxm has not placed this declaration in this project yet
legend-file-unreadable = the host file cannot be placed as it is; the diagnostics say why
legend-file-modified = the sandbox copy was changed after sbxm placed it
legend-file-unrecorded = the sandbox copy differs from the host file, and sbxm has no record of placing it
legend-defaults = nothing is declared, so the defaults apply
legend-error = could not be verified, or does not meet the requirement
legend-incomplete = registered, but its project metadata has not been created yet
legend-inconsistent = the project directory does not hold what the registry says it does
legend-not-created = the project is registered, but its sandbox does not exist yet
legend-sandbox-running = the sandbox is running
legend-sandbox-stopped = the sandbox exists but is not running; opening it starts the sandbox
legend-open-blocked = opening is blocked until a prior recovery action is completed
legend-running = the service is running
legend-stopped = the service is installed but not running

